BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:uLoB3Lv9eLwugKc3cW0Kep@commongroundmeditation.org
DTSTAMP:20260817T094924Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260819T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260819T210000
SUMMARY:📍💻 Weekly Practice Group with Shelly Graf
LOCATION:Common Ground Meditation Center\, 2700 E 26th St\, Minneapolis\, M
 N 55406
DESCRIPTION:Format: In person + Online\nTeacher: Shelly Graf\nProgram: Week
 ly Practice Groups\n\nThe weekly practice groups are designed to be a corn
 erstone for one's practice by providing ongoing instruction and teachings 
 that help illuminate the simple but challenging practice of mindfulness. T
 he Buddha taught that mindfulness is the way to go beyond habits of distra
 ction and grasping. To walk this path of wisdom and compassion\, we need t
 he support of a community that shares this intention. Each session include
 s a guided meditation\, dharma talk\, and discussion.\n\nShelly is working
  through Sharon Salzberg’s book Heart as Wide as the World. Both experie
 nced and beginning meditators are always welcome. No registration necessar
 y.\n\nAll programs at Common Ground are offered freely in the spirit of ge
 nerosity. If you'd like to volunteer or donate to support the teacher(s) a
 nd the center\, visit https://commongroundmeditation.org/volunteer or http
 s://commongroundmeditation.org/donate.\n\nWe may be recording this Zoom me
 eting in order to be able to share the teacher’s video on Youtube. Parti
 cipants’ video will not be included\, but the audio may be\, unless you 
 ask us not to. Contact info@commongroundmeditation.org with any questions 
 or concerns.\n\nZoom: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/83466749859?pwd=cEs5ZzZHVX
 JYcVU0Z0lXZ2pWY2F1dz09\n\nDetails: https://commongroundmeditation.org/cale
 ndar/event/weekly-practice-group-with-shelly-graf-in-person-or-on-zoom-uLo
 B3Lv9eLwugKc3cW0Kep
URL:https://commongroundmeditation.org/calendar/event/weekly-practice-group
 -with-shelly-graf-in-person-or-on-zoom-uLoB3Lv9eLwugKc3cW0Kep
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
