UID:QE2Ix2GOJNQ45eyJGZQVks@commongroundmeditation.org
DTSTAMP:20260817T094924Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260920T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260920T114500
SUMMARY:📍💻 Weekly Practice Group with Shelly Graf
LOCATION:Common Ground Meditation Center\, 2700 E 26th St\, Minneapolis\, M
 N 55406
DESCRIPTION:Format: In person + Online\nTeachers: Shelly Graf\, Mark Nunber
 g\nProgram: Weekly Practice Groups\n\nImmunocompromised Teacher(s) and Com
 munity Members.\n\nThis program is offered over Zoom\; the link to join is
  above. It is also simultaneously broadcast on Youtube and recorded. See
  below for more details.\n\nThe weekly practice groups are designed to be 
 a cornerstone for one's practice by providing ongoing instruction and teac
 hings that will help illuminate the simple but challenging practice of min
 dfulness. The Buddha taught that mindfulness is the way to go beyond habit
 s of distraction and grasping. To walk this path of wisdom and compassion\
 , we need the support of a community that shares this intention. Each sess
 ion includes a guided meditation\, dharma talk\, and discussion. Both expe
 rienced and beginning meditators are welcome. No registration necessary. L
 ed by Shelly Graf.\n\nFor resources shared by Mark Nunberg during the talk
 \, click here.\n\nAll programs at Common Ground are offered freely in the 
 spirit of generosity. If you'd like to volunteer or donate to support the 
 teacher(s) and the center\, click here.\n\nWe will be recording this Zoom 
 meeting in order to be able to share the teacher’s video on Youtube. Par
 ticipants’ video will not be included\, but the audio will be\, unless y
 ou ask us not to. Contact info@commongroundmeditation.org with any quest
 ions or concerns.\n\nThere will be an opportunity for small groups after t
 he Weekly Practice Group\, both in person and on Zoom.\n\nZoom: https://us
 02web.zoom.us/j/88125933686?pwd=b3DvW54lZqeOzCova1k2ozvLpOiG3E.1\n\nDetail
 s: https://commongroundmeditation.org/calendar/event/weekly-practice-group
 -with-mark-nunberg-QE2Ix2GOJNQ45eyJGZQVks
URL:https://commongroundmeditation.org/calendar/event/weekly-practice-group
 -with-mark-nunberg-QE2Ix2GOJNQ45eyJGZQVks
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
