BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:O0oQlxhY11zqvgklBFXsYR@commongroundmeditation.org
DTSTAMP:20260817T094924Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261002T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261002T203000
SUMMARY:📍💻 Lovingkindness Practice Group with Mark Nunberg
LOCATION:Common Ground Meditation Center\, 2700 E 26th St\, Minneapolis\, M
 N 55406
DESCRIPTION:Format: In person + Online\nTeachers: Mark Nunberg\, Stacy McCl
 endon\nProgram: Lovingkindness Programs\n\nLovingkindness Practice Group\n
 This practice group is for people interested in developing the heart by tr
 aining in the four beautiful emotions of lovingkindness (metta)\, compassi
 on\, empathetic joy\, and equanimity. Each session includes instruction\, 
 a guided meditation\, a short dharma talk\, and time for questions and dis
 cussion. Both experienced and beginning meditators are welcome\, no regist
 ration necessary. This practice group is led by Stacy McClendon and Mark N
 unberg. Generally\, the teachers lead on alternating months.\nIf you'd lik
 e to donate to support the teacher(s) and the center\, visit https://comm
 ongroundmeditation.org/donate. Be sure to enter Mark Nunberg in the Teache
 r/Program box. 2/3 of the donation supports the teacher(s) and 1/3 suppor
 ts the general operations of the center.\n\nZoom: https://us02web.zoom.us/
 j/82486884316?pwd=ckRBS0JGV0lxWTF1OUp5OCttdm1nUT09\n\nDetails: https://com
